Third-party components
----------------------
The Chip Loom Rust workspace depends on third-party crates published on
crates.io; the VS Code extension depends on packages published on npm.
Their licenses are reported by the standard tooling for each ecosystem:

    cargo tree --format "{p} {l}"
    npm ls --all --long

Chip Loom does not redistribute third-party compiler toolchains inside this
repository. From Phase 2 onwards, toolchains are downloaded on demand from
their upstream publishers and remain under their own licenses; Chip Loom
records the license of every artifact it installs.
